+## Common problems
+
+### Node Sass
+
+When using Node Sass styles, tell Cypress to use [the system NodeJS](https://on.cypress.io/configuration#Node-version) rather than its bundled version. In `cypress.json` set option:
+
+```json
+{
+  "nodeVersion": "system"
+}
+```
